{%- comment -%}
  KK FWS Offer — Single — Figma `7809:7653` (with a subscription), `8028:157` (without).

  The buy box for a product with ONE variant (e.g. POSTreat Steel): the KK FWS Offer's gallery,
  intro, white buy card, button, payments and product accordion, without the size / plan
  steps and order summary that only make sense for the multi-variant campaign tower.

  - The product has a selling plan (an Appstle subscription) on its variant: the intro sits
    above the card, and the card opens with the Subscribe & Save / One-Time toggle. Subscribe
    shows the subscription panel (save ribbon, struck price, subscription price, details and
    points) and posts the plan; One-Time posts none.
  - No selling plan: no toggle and no subscription panel — the intro moves into the card and
    the button follows it (Figma `8028:157`).

  NO PRICE IS TYPED INTO A SETTING. Every figure comes from the product: the variant's price
  and compare-at price, its first selling plan allocation (Appstle), and that plan's cadence.
  Authored copy refers to them with tokens, replaced by snippets/kk-fws-price-tokens.liquid:

    [price] [compare_price] [subscription_price] [save] [interval]   this product
    [refill_title] [refill_price] [refill_compare_price]
    [refill_subscription_price] [refill_save] [refill_interval]       the "Replacement product"
    [free_shipping]                                                   Theme settings > Your cart

  The refill tokens fall back to this product when no replacement product is picked. Token
  figures drop trailing zeros; the panel's own figures keep them.

  STYLES. The markup reuses the KK FWS Offer's `.kk-fws-offer__*` classes, so it inherits that
  section's stylesheet (Shopify bundles every section's stylesheet tag into one file that
  loads on every page). This file only adds what the offer doesn't have: the breadcrumb, the
  subscription panel, the "Subscription detail" disclosure, the button arrow, the shipping line
  and the two-column perks. A change to the offer's gallery, toggle, card or accordion styling
  therefore lands here too, which is the point — the two buy boxes stay one design.

  SCRIPTS are this section's own (the offer's are keyed to `#kk-fws-offer`, which this section
  deliberately does not use, so both can sit on one page without clashing): the pay toggle,
  the gallery thumbnails / video posters, and the Appstle guard.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  assign allocation = blank
  if variant.selling_plan_allocations.size > 0
    assign allocation = variant.selling_plan_allocations.first
  endif

  assign subscription_offered = false
  if allocation != blank
    assign subscription_offered = true
  endif

  comment
    A product that can only be bought on a plan gets no One-Time option, so no toggle either.
  endcomment
  assign show_toggle = subscription_offered
  if product.requires_selling_plan
    assign show_toggle = false
  endif

  assign default_pay = 'onetime'
  if subscription_offered
    if section.settings.default_pay == 'subscribe' or product.requires_selling_plan
      assign default_pay = 'subscribe'
    endif
  endif

  assign onetime_price = variant.price
  assign compare_price = variant.compare_at_price | default: 0
  assign subscription_price = onetime_price
  assign save_cents = 0
  assign selling_plan_id = ''
  if subscription_offered
    assign subscription_price = allocation.price
    assign save_cents = onetime_price | minus: subscription_price
    assign selling_plan_id = allocation.selling_plan.id
  endif

  comment
    The subscription panel strikes the compare-at price when there is one above the
    subscription price, else the one-time price.
  endcomment
  assign struck_price = 0
  if compare_price > subscription_price
    assign struck_price = compare_price
  elsif onetime_price > subscription_price
    assign struck_price = onetime_price
  endif

  assign onetime_money = onetime_price | money
  assign subscription_money = subscription_price | money

  assign interval = ''
  if subscription_offered
    capture interval
      render 'kk-fws-plan-interval', selling_plan: allocation.selling_plan
    endcapture
  endif

  comment
    The replacement product (e.g. the refill media a subscription delivers), for the refill
    tokens. Falls back to this product.
  endcomment
  assign refill = section.settings.replacement_product | default: product
  assign refill_variant = refill.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign refill_price = refill_variant.price
  assign refill_compare = refill_variant.compare_at_price | default: 0
  assign refill_subscription_price = refill_price
  assign refill_interval = ''
  if refill_variant.selling_plan_allocations.size > 0
    assign refill_allocation = refill_variant.selling_plan_allocations.first
    assign refill_subscription_price = refill_allocation.price
    capture refill_interval
      render 'kk-fws-plan-interval', selling_plan: refill_allocation.selling_plan
    endcapture
  endif
  assign refill_save = refill_price | minus: refill_subscription_price

  assign free_shipping_cents = settings.free_shipping_threshold | times: 100

  assign t_price = onetime_price | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign t_compare = compare_price | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign t_subscription = subscription_price | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign t_save = save_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign t_refill_price = refill_price | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign t_refill_compare = refill_compare | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign t_refill_subscription = refill_subscription_price | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign t_refill_save = refill_save | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign t_free_shipping = free_shipping_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros

  capture price_tokens
    echo '[price]~~' | append: t_price
    echo '||[compare_price]~~' | append: t_compare
    echo '||[subscription_price]~~' | append: t_subscription
    echo '||[save]~~' | append: t_save
    echo '||[interval]~~' | append: interval
    echo '||[refill_title]~~' | append: refill.title
    echo '||[refill_price]~~' | append: t_refill_price
    echo '||[refill_compare_price]~~' | append: t_refill_compare
    echo '||[refill_subscription_price]~~' | append: t_refill_subscription
    echo '||[refill_save]~~' | append: t_refill_save
    echo '||[refill_interval]~~' | append: refill_interval
    echo '||[free_shipping]~~' | append: t_free_shipping
  endcapture

  comment
    Rating — the reviews app's metafields, else the "Rating score" / "Rating count" settings.
  endcomment
  assign rating_score = section.settings.rating_score
  assign rating_count = section.settings.rating_count
  if product.metafields.reviews.rating.value != blank
    assign rating_score = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating | round: 2
  endif
  if product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value > 0
    assign rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value
  endif
  assign rating_text = ''
  if rating_score != blank and section.settings.rating_text != blank
    assign rating_text = section.settings.rating_text | replace: '[score]', rating_score | replace: '[count]', rating_count
  endif

  assign intro_headline = section.settings.headline | default: product.title

  assign media_limit = section.settings.media_limit
  assign gallery_count = 0

  assign perk_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'perk'
  assign point_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'subscription_point'
-%}

{%- capture intro -%}
  <div class="kk-fws-offer__intro">
    {%- if rating_text != blank -%}
      <div class="kk-fws-offer__rating kk-fws-offer-single__rating">
        <img
          class="kk-fws-offer__rating-stars"
          src="{{ 'kk-fws-icon-stars-gold.svg' | asset_url }}"
          alt=""
          width="126"
          height="21"
          aria-hidden="true"
          loading="lazy"
        >
        <span class="kk-fws-offer__rating-count">{{ rating_text }}</span>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <h1 class="kk-fws-offer__title">{{ intro_headline }}</h1>

    {%- if section.settings.tap_badge_text != blank -%}
      <p class="kk-fws-offer__tap-badge">
        {%- if section.settings.tap_badge_icon != blank -%}
          {{
            section.settings.tap_badge_icon
            | image_url: width: 52
            | image_tag: class: 'kk-fws-offer__tap-badge-icon', width: 26, height: 18, loading: 'lazy', alt: ''
          }}
        {%- elsif section.settings.tap_badge_flag -%}
          <img
            class="kk-fws-offer__tap-badge-icon"
            src="{{ 'kk-fws-icon-flag-us.svg' | asset_url }}"
            alt=""
            width="26"
            height="18"
            aria-hidden="true"
            loading="lazy"
          >
        {%- endif -%}
        {{- section.settings.tap_badge_text -}}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.introduction != blank -%}
      <div class="kk-fws-offer__introduction">{%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.introduction, tokens: price_tokens -%}</div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endcapture -%}

<section
  class="kk-fws-offer kk-fws-offer-single{% unless subscription_offered %} kk-fws-offer-single--no-subscription{% endunless %}"
  {% if section.settings.anchor_id != blank %}id="{{ section.settings.anchor_id | handle }}"{% endif %}
  data-kk-fws-offer-single
  data-kk-fws-pay-mode="{{ default_pay }}"
  style="
    --kk-fws-offer-background: {{ section.settings.background_color }};
    --kk-fws-offer-single-arrow: url('{{ 'kk-fws-icon-button-arrow.svg' | asset_url }}');
  "
>
  <div class="kk-fws-offer__container kk-fws-container">
    {%- if product == blank -%}
      <p class="kk-fws-offer__notice">
        This section needs a product. Preview it on a product template.
      </p>
    {%- else -%}
      {%- if section.settings.show_breadcrumb -%}
        <nav class="kk-fws-offer-single__breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <ol class="kk-fws-offer-single__breadcrumb-list">
            <li><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ section.settings.breadcrumb_home }}</a></li>
            {%- if section.settings.breadcrumb_parent != blank -%}
              <li><a href="{{ section.settings.breadcrumb_parent_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ section.settings.breadcrumb_parent }}</a></li>
            {%- endif -%}
            <li aria-current="page">{{ section.settings.breadcrumb_current | default: product.title }}</li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="kk-fws-offer__layout">
        <div class="kk-fws-offer__media">
          {%- comment -%}
            id="product-slider" is what src/js/sliders.js keys its gallery options on (no loop,
            no autoplay, not centred) and the name it registers the instance under, which the
            thumbnail script below drives. One per page: don't pair this section with another
            gallery that uses the same id.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <div
            id="product-slider"
            class="swiper-container swiper kk-fws-offer__slider"
            data-slidestoshow="1"
            aria-label="{{ section.settings.gallery_label | replace: '[title]', product.title | escape }}"
          >
            <div class="swiper-wrapper">
              {%- for media in product.media -%}
                {%- if media.media_type == 'image' or media.media_type == 'video' or media.media_type == 'external_video' -%}
                  {%- if media_limit > 0 and gallery_count >= media_limit -%}
                    {%- break -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- assign gallery_count = gallery_count | plus: 1 -%}
                  {%- assign media_alt = media.alt | default: product.title -%}
                  <div class="swiper-slide kk-fws-offer__slide">
                    {%- if media.media_type == 'image' -%}
                      {{
                        media.preview_image
                        | image_url: width: 1140
                        | image_tag:
                          class: 'kk-fws-offer__slide-image',
                          loading: 'lazy',
                          widths: '375, 570, 750, 1140',
                          sizes: '(max-width: 749px) calc(100vw - 4rem), 569px',
                          alt: media_alt
                      }}
                    {%- else -%}
                      <div
                        class="kk-fws-offer__video"
                        data-kk-fws-video
                        {% if media.media_type == 'external_video' %}
                          data-kk-fws-video-embed="{{ media | external_video_url: autoplay: 'true' | escape }}"
                        {% else %}
                          data-kk-fws-video-src="{{ media.sources.last.url | escape }}"
                        {% endif %}
                      >
                        {{
                          media.preview_image
                          | image_url: width: 1140
                          | image_tag:
                            class: 'kk-fws-offer__slide-image',
                            loading: 'lazy',
                            widths: '375, 570, 750, 1140',
                            sizes: '(max-width: 749px) calc(100vw - 4rem), 569px',
                            alt: media_alt
                        }}
                        <button class="kk-fws-offer__play" type="button">
                          <span class="sr-only">{{ section.settings.play_video_label }}</span>
                        </button>
                      </div>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
              {%- if gallery_count == 0 -%}
                <div class="swiper-slide kk-fws-offer__slide">
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'kk-fws-offer__slide-image' }}
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            <button
              class="swiper-prev kk-fws-offer__nav kk-fws-offer__nav--prev"
              type="button"
              aria-label="{{ section.settings.previous_label | escape }}"
            >
              <img
                class="kk-fws-offer__nav-icon"
                src="{{ 'kk-fws-icon-gallery-arrow.svg' | asset_url }}"
                alt=""
                width="18"
                height="18"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
            </button>
            <button
              class="swiper-next kk-fws-offer__nav kk-fws-offer__nav--next"
              type="button"
              aria-label="{{ section.settings.next_label | escape }}"
            >
              <img
                class="kk-fws-offer__nav-icon"
                src="{{ 'kk-fws-icon-gallery-arrow.svg' | asset_url }}"
                alt=""
                width="18"
                height="18"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
            </button>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} A plain grid, not a `.control` Swiper — see the note in kk-fws-offer.liquid. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if gallery_count > 1 -%}
            {%- assign thumb_index = 0 -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign thumb_columns = gallery_count
              if thumb_columns > 5
                assign thumb_columns = 5
              endif
            -%}
            <div
              class="kk-fws-offer__thumbs"
              data-kk-fws-thumbs
              role="tablist"
              aria-label="{{ section.settings.thumbs_label | escape }}"
              style="--kk-fws-offer-single-thumbs: {{ thumb_columns }};"
            >
              {%- for media in product.media -%}
                {%- if media.media_type == 'image' or media.media_type == 'video' or media.media_type == 'external_video' -%}
                  {%- if thumb_index >= gallery_count -%}
                    {%- break -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <button
                    class="kk-fws-offer__thumb"
                    type="button"
                    role="tab"
                    data-kk-fws-thumb="{{ thumb_index }}"
                    aria-label="Show image {{ thumb_index | plus: 1 }}"
                    aria-selected="{% if thumb_index == 0 %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                  >
                    {{
                      media.preview_image
                      | image_url: width: 300
                      | image_tag:
                        class: 'kk-fws-offer__thumb-image',
                        loading: 'lazy',
                        widths: '150, 300',
                        sizes: '135px',
                        alt: ''
                    }}
                    {%- unless media.media_type == 'image' -%}
                      <span class="kk-fws-offer__thumb-play" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    {%- endunless -%}
                  </button>
                  {%- assign thumb_index = thumb_index | plus: 1 -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        <div class="kk-fws-offer__panel">
          {%- if subscription_offered -%}
            {{ intro }}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- form 'product', product, class: 'kk-fws-offer__form', novalidate: 'novalidate' -%}
            {%- unless subscription_offered -%}
              {{ intro }}
            {%- endunless -%}

            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}" data-variant-select>

            {%- comment -%}
              The posted plan. Disabled = not submitted, which is the One-Time state (Shopify
              rejects an empty `selling_plan`). `data-kk-fws-selling-plan` marks it as ours for
              the Appstle guard below.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if subscription_offered -%}
              <input
                type="hidden"
                name="selling_plan"
                value="{{ selling_plan_id }}"
                data-kk-fws-selling-plan
                {% if default_pay != 'subscribe' %}disabled{% endif %}
              >
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if show_toggle -%}
              <fieldset class="kk-fws-offer__pays">
                <legend class="kk-fws-offer__step kk-fws-offer__step--hidden">
                  <span class="kk-fws-offer__step-title">{{ section.settings.pay_legend }}</span>
                </legend>

                <div class="kk-fws-offer__pay-list">
                  <label class="kk-fws-offer__pay">
                    <input
                      class="kk-fws-offer__pay-input"
                      type="radio"
                      name="kk-fws-single-pay-{{ section.id }}"
                      value="subscribe"
                      data-kk-fws-pay="subscribe"
                      {% if default_pay == 'subscribe' %}checked{% endif %}
                    >
                    <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-card">
                      {%- if section.settings.subscribe_ribbon != blank and save_cents > 0 -%}
                        <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-ribbon">
                          {%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.subscribe_ribbon, tokens: price_tokens -%}
                        </span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-body">
                        <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-name">
                          <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-label">{%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.subscribe_label, tokens: price_tokens -%}</span>
                        </span>
                      </span>
                    </span>
                  </label>

                  <label class="kk-fws-offer__pay">
                    <input
                      class="kk-fws-offer__pay-input"
                      type="radio"
                      name="kk-fws-single-pay-{{ section.id }}"
                      value="onetime"
                      data-kk-fws-pay="onetime"
                      {% if default_pay != 'subscribe' %}checked{% endif %}
                    >
                    <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-card">
                      <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-body">
                        <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-name">
                          <span class="kk-fws-offer__pay-label">
                            {%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.onetime_label, tokens: price_tokens -%}
                            {%- if section.settings.onetime_show_price -%}
                              <span class="kk-fws-offer-single__pay-dot" aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
                              <span class="kk-fws-offer-single__pay-price">{{ onetime_money }}</span>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </span>
                        </span>
                      </span>
                    </span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if subscription_offered -%}
              {%- comment -%} Subscribe & Save only — Figma `7809:7801`. {%- endcomment -%}
              <div class="kk-fws-offer-single__subscription" data-kk-fws-face="subscribe">
                <div class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan">
                  {%- if section.settings.plan_ribbon != blank and save_cents > 0 -%}
                    <span class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-ribbon">
                      {%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.plan_ribbon, tokens: price_tokens -%}
                    </span>
                  {%- endif -%}

                  <div class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-head">
                    <p class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-title">{%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.plan_title, tokens: price_tokens -%}</p>
                    <p class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-price">
                      {%- if struck_price > 0 -%}
                        <s class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-compare">{{ struck_price | money }}</s>
                      {%- endif -%}
                      <span class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-amount">{{ subscription_money }}</span>
                    </p>
                  </div>

                  {%- if section.settings.plan_text != blank or point_blocks.size > 0 -%}
                    <hr class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-rule">

                    <div class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-details">
                      {%- if section.settings.plan_text != blank -%}
                        <div class="kk-fws-offer-single__plan-text">{%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.plan_text, tokens: price_tokens -%}</div>
                      {%- endif -%}

                      {%- if point_blocks.size > 0 -%}
                        <ul class="kk-fws-offer-single__points">
                          {%- for block in point_blocks -%}
                            <li class="kk-fws-offer-single__point" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                              <img
                                class="kk-fws-offer-single__point-icon"
                                src="{{ 'kk-fws-icon-check-blue.svg' | asset_url }}"
                                alt=""
                                width="20"
                                height="20"
                                aria-hidden="true"
                                loading="lazy"
                              >
                              <span class="kk-fws-offer-single__point-text">{%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: block.settings.text, tokens: price_tokens -%}</span>
                            </li>
                          {%- endfor -%}
                        </ul>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>

                {%- if section.settings.detail_label != blank and section.settings.detail_content != blank -%}
                  <details class="kk-fws-offer-single__detail">
                    <summary class="kk-fws-offer-single__detail-summary">
                      <img
                        class="kk-fws-offer-single__detail-icon"
                        src="{{ 'kk-fws-icon-clock.svg' | asset_url }}"
                        alt=""
                        width="18"
                        height="18"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                        loading="lazy"
                      >
                      {%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.detail_label, tokens: price_tokens -%}
                    </summary>
                    <div class="kk-fws-offer-single__detail-content">{%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.detail_content, tokens: price_tokens -%}</div>
                  </details>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            <div class="kk-fws-offer__button-wrap">
              {%- if variant.available -%}
                <button
                  class="kk-fws-offer__button kk-fws-offer-single__button{% if section.settings.button_arrow %} kk-fws-offer-single__button--arrow{% endif %}"
                  type="submit"
                  name="add"
                >
                  {%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.button_label, tokens: price_tokens -%}
                </button>
              {%- else -%}
                <button class="kk-fws-offer__button kk-fws-offer-single__button" type="button" disabled>
                  {{- section.settings.sold_out_text -}}
                </button>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if section.settings.shipping_text != blank -%}
                <p class="kk-fws-offer-single__shipping">{%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: section.settings.shipping_text, tokens: price_tokens -%}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            {%- if section.settings.show_payment_icons and shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
              <ul class="kk-fws-offer__payments" aria-label="{{ section.settings.payments_label | escape }}">
                {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
                  <li class="kk-fws-offer__payment">{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'kk-fws-offer__payment-icon' }}</li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if perk_blocks.size > 0 -%}
              <ul class="kk-fws-offer-single__perks">
                {%- for block in perk_blocks -%}
                  <li class="kk-fws-offer-single__perk" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    <span class="kk-fws-offer-single__perk-tile" aria-hidden="true">
                      {%- if block.settings.custom_icon != blank -%}
                        {{
                          block.settings.custom_icon
                          | image_url: width: 44
                          | image_tag: class: 'kk-fws-offer-single__perk-icon', width: 22, height: 22, loading: 'lazy', alt: ''
                        }}
                      {%- else -%}
                        <img
                          class="kk-fws-offer-single__perk-icon"
                          src="{{ 'kk-fws-icon-' | append: block.settings.icon | append: '.svg' | asset_url }}"
                          alt=""
                          width="22"
                          height="22"
                          loading="lazy"
                        >
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                    <span class="kk-fws-offer-single__perk-text">{%- render 'kk-fws-price-tokens', text: block.settings.text, tokens: price_tokens -%}</span>
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endform -%}
        </div>

        {%- comment -%}
          Product accordion — same panels as the KK FWS Offer (snippets/accordion-panels.liquid),
          under the gallery on desktop and after the buy card when stacked. `section-accordion`
          is what main.css scopes every accordion rule under; see kk-fws-offer.liquid.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.show_accordion -%}
          {%- assign accordion_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'accordion_item' -%}
          <div class="kk-fws-offer__accordion section-accordion">
            {% render 'accordion-panels', blocks: accordion_blocks %}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{%- if product != blank -%}
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.currentScript && document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;
      if (!root || !root.hasAttribute('data-kk-fws-offer-single')) return;

      var form = root.querySelector('form[action*="/cart/add"]');
      var planInput = root.querySelector('[data-kk-fws-selling-plan]');

      // Pay toggle: the root's data-kk-fws-pay-mode drives the toggle thumb and shows the
      // matching [data-kk-fws-face] (both styled by the KK FWS Offer's stylesheet); the
      // plan input is only submitted while subscribing.
      [].forEach.call(root.querySelectorAll('[data-kk-fws-pay]'), function (input) {
        input.addEventListener('change', function () {
          if (!input.checked) return;
          var mode = input.getAttribute('data-kk-fws-pay');
          root.setAttribute('data-kk-fws-pay-mode', mode);
          if (planInput) planInput.disabled = mode !== 'subscribe';
        });
      });

      // Appstle guard: the app injects its own selling_plan radios into every product form and
      // pre-checks one. Only this section's input may set the plan, so disable the app's.
      if (form) {
        var neutralise = function () {
          [].forEach.call(form.querySelectorAll('[name="selling_plan"]:not([data-kk-fws-selling-plan])'), function (el) {
            el.checked = false;
            el.disabled = true;
          });
        };
        neutralise();
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', neutralise);
        window.addEventListener('load', neutralise);
        if (window.MutationObserver) {
          new MutationObserver(neutralise).observe(form, { childList: true, subtree: true });
        }
      }

      // Gallery: the theme initialises the slider (src/js/sliders.js) and registers it at
      // window.sliders['product-slider']; this only drives the thumbnails and video posters.
      var slider = root.querySelector('.kk-fws-offer__slider');
      var thumbs = [].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('[data-kk-fws-thumb]'));
      var reduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

      function syncThumbs(active) {
        thumbs.forEach(function (thumb) {
          var on = parseInt(thumb.getAttribute('data-kk-fws-thumb'), 10) === active;
          thumb.setAttribute('aria-selected', on ? 'true' : 'false');
          thumb.classList.toggle('is-active', on);
        });
      }

      if (slider && thumbs.length) {
        var attempts = 0;
        (function poll() {
          var instance = window.sliders ? window.sliders[slider.id] : null;
          if (!instance || typeof instance.slideTo !== 'function') {
            if (++attempts <= 60) window.setTimeout(poll, 100);
            return;
          }
          syncThumbs(instance.activeIndex);
          thumbs.forEach(function (thumb) {
            thumb.addEventListener('click', function () {
              instance.slideTo(parseInt(thumb.getAttribute('data-kk-fws-thumb'), 10), reduced ? 0 : 400);
            });
          });
          instance.on('slideChange', function () {
            syncThumbs(instance.activeIndex);
          });
        })();
      }

      root.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
        var trigger = event.target.closest ? event.target.closest('.kk-fws-offer__play') : null;
        if (!trigger) return;
        var holder = trigger.closest('[data-kk-fws-video]');
        if (!holder || holder.querySelector('video, iframe')) return;

        var embed = holder.getAttribute('data-kk-fws-video-embed');
        var src = holder.getAttribute('data-kk-fws-video-src');
        var player;
        if (embed) {
          player = document.createElement('iframe');
          player.setAttribute('src', embed);
          player.setAttribute('allow', 'autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture');
          player.setAttribute('allowfullscreen', 'allowfullscreen');
          player.setAttribute('title', 'Product video');
        } else if (src) {
          player = document.createElement('video');
          player.setAttribute('src', src);
          player.setAttribute('controls', 'controls');
          player.setAttribute('playsinline', 'playsinline');
          player.setAttribute('autoplay', 'autoplay');
        } else {
          return;
        }
        player.className = 'kk-fws-offer__video-player';
        holder.appendChild(player);
        trigger.hidden = true;
      });
    })();
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Only what the KK FWS Offer's stylesheet doesn't already cover — see the note at the top. */

  /* Breadcrumb — Figma `7809:7654`: 14px, muted trail, the current page in navy, 28px above
     the columns. */
  .kk-fws-offer-single__breadcrumb {
    align-self: stretch;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 2.8rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__breadcrumb-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-family: 'Value Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #6b7085;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__breadcrumb-list li + li::before {
    content: '/';
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__breadcrumb-list a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__breadcrumb-list a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__breadcrumb-list [aria-current] {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Thumbnails — Figma `7809:7672`: one row of up to five (the offer's strip is four across). */
  .kk-fws-offer-single .kk-fws-offer__thumbs {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--kk-fws-offer-single-thumbs, 4), minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  /* Intro — Figma `7809:7726`: the rating sits above the title here, 11px gaps. */
  .kk-fws-offer-single .kk-fws-offer__intro {
    gap: 1.09rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single .kk-fws-offer__title {
    font-size: 4.4rem;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.06rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__rating .kk-fws-offer__rating-count {
    font-size: 1.7rem;
  }

  /* Without a subscription the intro sits inside the card (Figma `8028:230`). */
  .kk-fws-offer-single--no-subscription .kk-fws-offer__form {
    gap: 2.6rem;
    padding: 2.8rem;
  }

  /* "One-Time Purchase · [variant price]" — Figma `7809:7799`. */
  .kk-fws-offer-single__pay-dot {
    color: #a3a7bf;
  }

  /* Subscription panel — Figma `7809:7801`: pale blue, 2px blue border, 16px corners, the save
     ribbon hanging over the top edge. */
  .kk-fws-offer-single__subscription {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.6rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    padding: 2.8rem 2.2rem 2.2rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--primary-600);
    border-radius: 1.6rem;
    background: #f2f6ff;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-ribbon {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1.1rem;
    left: 2.4rem;
    padding: 0.64rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 0.8rem;
    background: var(--primary-600);
    font-family: 'Value Sans Bold', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.14rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
    padding-left: 0.2rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Value Sans Bold', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 2.3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-compare {
    font-family: 'Value Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #a3a7bf;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-amount {
    font-family: 'Value Sans Bold', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 3.1rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.06rem;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-rule {
    width: auto;
    height: 1px;
    margin: 0 0.2rem;
    border: 0;
    background: #d9e3ff;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    padding: 0 0.2rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-text,
  .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-text p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Value Sans Medium', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__points {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__point {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__point-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  /* Bold reads navy, italic is struck through (an old price, e.g. "at [refill_price] [refill_subscription_price]"). */
  .kk-fws-offer-single__point-text {
    font-family: 'Value Sans', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--primary-100);
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__point-text strong,
  .kk-fws-offer-single__point-text b {
    font-family: 'Value Sans Bold', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__point-text em,
  .kk-fws-offer-single__point-text i {
    font-style: normal;
    text-decoration: line-through;
  }

  /* "Subscription detail" — Figma `7809:7839`: a small blue disclosure under the panel. */
  .kk-fws-offer-single__detail-summary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    font-family: 'Value Sans Medium', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--primary-600);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__detail-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__detail-icon {
    width: 1.8rem;
    height: 1.8rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__detail-content {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    font-family: 'Value Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--primary-100);
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__detail-content p {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
  }

  /* Button — Figma `7809:7848`: ADD TO CART with a 24px arrow. The arrow is a pseudo-element
     because the theme's ajax cart rewrites the button's textContent while adding; its URL
     comes in as a custom property from the markup (Liquid doesn't run in the stylesheet tag). */
  .kk-fws-offer-single__button--arrow::after {
    content: '';
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2.4rem;
    height: 2.4rem;
    background: var(--kk-fws-offer-single-arrow) center / contain no-repeat;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single .kk-fws-offer-single__button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single .kk-fws-offer__button-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2.2rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__shipping {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Value Sans Medium', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Perks — Figma `7809:7860`: two columns of icon tiles (44px, pale blue, 12px corners). */
  .kk-fws-offer-single__perks {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, max-content);
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.2rem 2.4rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem 0.2rem;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__perk {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__perk-tile {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 4.4rem;
    height: 4.4rem;
    border-radius: 1.2rem;
    background: #f2f6ff;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__perk-icon {
    display: block;
    width: 2.2rem;
    height: 2.2rem;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .kk-fws-offer-single__perk-text {
    font-family: 'Value Sans Medium', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .kk-fws-offer-single .kk-fws-offer__title {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
    }

    /* The narrow toggle wraps: price on its own line, no orphaned dot. */
    .kk-fws-offer-single__pay-dot {
      display: none;
    }

    .kk-fws-offer-single__pay-price {
      display: block;
    }

    .kk-fws-offer-single--no-subscription .kk-fws-offer__form {
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .kk-fws-offer-single__plan {
      padding: 2.4rem 1.6rem 1.8rem;
    }

    .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-amount {
      font-size: 2.6rem;
    }

    .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-text,
    .kk-fws-offer-single__plan-text p,
    .kk-fws-offer-single__point-text {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }

    .kk-fws-offer-single__perks {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      padding: 0;
    }

    .kk-fws-offer-single__perk-text {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

